# Every text file is checked out with LF on every OS: signed fixtures (SHA256SUMS), generated
# documents and the tests that read source files compare bytes, and a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf would turn them into CRLF (the platforms workflow's Windows runners).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.dmg binary
*.woff2 binary
